With This Ring is a romance, comedy, tv movie film directed by Nzingha Stewart.

2
00:12:21,176 --> 00:12:27,176
After attending their friend Elise's wedding to Nate on New Year's Eve, Trista, a career-­driven talent agent, Viviane, a successful gossip
columnist, and Amaya, a struggling actress, make a pact to get married within the year to either a new love or a man waiting in the wings.

3
00:18:31,764 --> 00:18:37,764
But the close friends face their own set of challenges - Trista has not gotten over her commitment-­phobic ex-­boyfriend Damon, Viviane is secretly in love
with Sean, the father of her son, and Amaya is desperate to break up her boyfriend Keith's unhappy marriage so they can live happily ever after.

4
00:24:42,352 --> 00:24:48,352
Each woman starts the year with high hopes and dreams of
what will happen over the next 12 months...

5
